cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "linear-elastic-plate-with-hole: a multi-solver benchmark for the infinite plate with a hole problem"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark repository for the linear elastic infinite plate with a circular
  hole problem. It provides reference implementations and simulation
  workflows for several finite-element solvers (FEniCS, Kratos Multiphysics,
  ExtendableFEM) together with problem documentation, postprocessing scripts,
  and RO-Crate-compatible benchmark packaging.
